{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"1629","name":"冰风迷途的勇士","desc":"冰风迷途的勇士","icon_url":"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/08/76373921/536e21d5580b6185a594e88664a59db9_2765213114928943229.jpg","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"基础信息","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\" 稀有度 \",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e4星/5星\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\" 获取途径 \",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"1378\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/04/23/79683714/3e9225fa84ede9010fe7f28eddb21ca5_7013407292756971138.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"芬德尼尔之顶\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1378/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1378/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e芬德尼尔之顶\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e：告死之霜Ⅰ～ Ⅳ 概率掉落（4星）；告死之霜Ⅲ～ Ⅳ 概率掉落（5星）；\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e合成台「还圣奥迹」获取；\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"502145\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/08/28/50494840/d29726b96c9ee790cae261ddbc5f9989_3936286629804858604.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"圣言自明机\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/502145/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/502145/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e圣言自明机\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e定义获取。\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"2件套效果 \",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e获得15%冰元素伤害加成。\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"4件套效果 \",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e攻击处于冰元素影响下的敌人时，暴击率提高20%；若敌人处于冻结状态下，则暴击率额外提高20%。\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"4","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"生之花","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"artifact_list_v2","layout":"","data":"{\"title\":\"生之花：\",\"name\":{\"key\":\"生之花：\",\"value\":[\"历经风雪的思念\"]},\"icon_url\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/10/12/4521515/536e21d5580b6185a594e88664a59db9_5229477837289535199.jpg\",\"desc\":{\"key\":\"描述：\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e早已绝迹的冰川之花，霜结着点点冰露。孤高的勇士也曾为这朵鲜花折腰。\u003c/p\u003e\"]},\"story\":{\"key\":\"故事\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e这朵永恒冻结的冰之花，由纤柔的双手摘下。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e对某人而言，能让他视严寒如温暖的拥抱吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e「这里的第四幅壁画为你而准备，你的形象将会永远留在这面墙上」\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e「为了这幅壁画，为了大家，我会一直在这里等你，祈祷你的归来」\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e少女站在空白的墙壁前，微笑着在勇士的胸前佩上一朵小花。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e那是优雅而从容不迫的人儿，即使面对死亡与绝境也是同样。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e待古老的史诗湮没在北境的烈风暴雪中，\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e而后风雪也消融净尽，这朵花仍未凋零。\u003c/p\u003e\"]}}\n","style":""}],"id":"5","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"死之羽","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"artifact_list_v2","layout":"","data":"{\"title\":\"死之羽：\",\"name\":{\"key\":\"死之羽：\",\"value\":[\"摧冰而行的执望\"]},\"icon_url\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/10/12/4521515/bca331d6c0f89005b7aa0ac2ddeee714_7080929150842196560.jpg\",\"desc\":{\"key\":\"描述：\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e散布寒冬的鸟羽，仿佛能感受到猛禽在雪原与冰峰之上呼号翱翔的振翅之风。\u003c/p\u003e\"]},\"story\":{\"key\":\"故事\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e本不属于寒冬的猛禽翎羽，有着冰冷的触感。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e触之仿佛能感受到暴雪中不屈而无望的呼号。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e不寻洞窟，不筑巢穴，傲然面对寒风而鸣的鸟遗下的羽毛，\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e受到寒风吹袭而覆雪凝霜，看起来恍如镶嵌了晶莹的宝石。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e这支羽毛最初来自一只飞鹰，寒冬的风将它粗暴地扯下。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e随风飞舞的途中先被冰霜拖累，后不堪重负地落入雪地。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e「我相信，欢快聒噪的鸟雀会随着你的脚步，飞回重又苍翠的夏宫园林」\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e「那些被寒潮驱逐的生灵，失去故乡的可怜孩子，将随你返归梦中的巢」\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e身负重托的勇士在茫茫风雪中踟躇，努力辨认着飞羽的颜色。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e被风雪沾湿封冻的鸟羽，一如随勇士的脚步褪色的遥远嘱托。\u003c/p\u003e\"]}}\n","style":""}],"id":"6","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"时之沙","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"artifact_list_v2","layout":"","data":"{\"title\":\"时之沙：\",\"name\":{\"key\":\"时之沙：\",\"value\":[\"冰雪故园的终期\"]},\"icon_url\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/10/12/4521515/a6f2650725b0f271230fb67c8cc8886d_5689647102515120685.jpg\",\"desc\":{\"key\":\"描述：\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e等待勇士归来的故国人民所用的时计。其中流淌的并不是沙，而是不化的冰屑。\u003c/p\u003e\"]},\"story\":{\"key\":\"故事\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e一尊古老的沙漏，其中流淌着细小的冰晶。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e即使最酷烈的寒流也无法冻结永流的时间。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e「天降的严寒甚至足以冻结时间」\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e雪葬的山都之中，有这样的传言。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e当勇士越过冰风之墙时，时值深夜，雪暴呼啸。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e无论是日光或是月光都无法轻易穿透苍白之风。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e无论何种严寒暴雪，都无法令时间的洪流凝滞。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e即使都城已被掩埋在寒冰之下。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e即使英雄本身也随着记忆消逝。\u003c/p\u003e\"]}}\n","style":""}],"id":"7","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"空之杯","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"artifact_list_v2","layout":"","data":"{\"title\":\"空之杯：\",\"name\":{\"key\":\"空之杯：\",\"value\":[\"遍结寒霜的傲骨\"]},\"icon_url\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/10/12/4521515/f523f9d8e9bc42f334270ea049231e25_2235897430917360050.jpg\",\"desc\":{\"key\":\"描述：\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e用寒冰雕制成的杯盖，如冬天一般坚利。曾经的主人从中啜饮过不冻之酒。\u003c/p\u003e\"]},\"story\":{\"key\":\"故事\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e曾在凛冬中替人寻找希望的异邦人，\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e即使是畅饮之器也以晶冰雕刻而成。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e从这杯中饮下的苦酒，寒冷如刀，穿喉入腹，\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e常人敬而远之的口感，却令沉默的勇士流连。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e他是寒冰般沉默的战士，以身躯阻挡着自星辰而来的刺骨罡风。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e不满足于受保护的绘画少女，她向倾慕的人留下这最后的嘱咐：\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e「假如天性中的胆怯与绝望将你压倒，令你终于不再归来，那么\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e…\u003c/span\u003e」\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e「\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e…\u003c/span\u003e请你活下去。请不要与我们共同走向灭亡，湮没于冰冷的遗忘」\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e饮下践行的寒冷苦酒，不再直面少女润湿的双眸，\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e踏上了无止境的追寻之途，向着雪境与深邃之地。\u003c/p\u003e\"]}}\n","style":""}],"id":"8","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"理之冠","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"artifact_list_v2","layout":"","data":"{\"title\":\"理之冠：\",\"name\":{\"key\":\"理之冠：\",\"value\":[\"破冰踏雪的回音\"]},\"icon_url\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/10/12/4521515/44c96981d7e5f6ceeaa287e53679440f_6957226467645756378.jpg\",\"desc\":{\"key\":\"描述：\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e梦想征服冰雪的古代英雄冠冕，是驱使它的故主直面刻骨寒冬的勇气之证。\u003c/p\u003e\"]},\"story\":{\"key\":\"故事\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e英雄身负雪都仅剩的渺小希望，踏上寻找救赎之旅。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e头戴寒冬的冠冕，高傲地消失在无垠寒风雪暴之中。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e背负着山城的契约，背负着清澈的目光，沧桑的勇士从来不曾恐惧冰幕外的未知。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e曾经一度苍翠的山间盛景、久远高天不再降下的祝福，皆是勇士永无停歇的动力。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e「越过冰封的门扉，走下深邃的回廊」\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e「他折下银白枝条，为雪国带来希望」\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e少女为族人唱着安抚的歌，呵护着有关于他的一切记忆。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e她坚信他会回到身旁，携着和煦春光与无可变夺的希望。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e但在最后踏雪而去的勇士终究没能及时返回。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e久已磨灭于风雪的憎恨言语控诉着他的逃亡\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e…\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]}}\n","style":""}],"id":"9","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"搭配推荐","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"multi_table","layout":"","data":"{\"tables\":[{\"tab_name\":\"角色推荐\",\"header\":[\"角色名称\",\"推荐原因\",\"词缀搭配\"],\"row\":[[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"1433\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/08/23/75276545/8b9946e573bf7aff9801c580707a23e1_3026364173026253689.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"甘雨\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1433/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1433/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/08/23/75276545/8b9946e573bf7aff9801c580707a23e1_3026364173026253689.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e甘雨\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e冰风迷途的勇士能为甘雨带来冰元素伤害加成以及大量的暴击率加成。使得甘雨能在不堆暴击率的情况下不缺暴击率。是永冻流和纯冰流甘雨的毕业圣遗物首选。融化流甘雨带4\u003ca href=\\\"https://bbs.mihoyo.com/ys/obc/content/1638/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e乐团\u003c/a\u003e。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e时之沙：\u003c/strong\u003e攻击力百分比\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e空之杯：\u003c/strong\u003e冰元素伤害加成\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e理之冠：\u003c/strong\u003e暴击伤害\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e暴击率/暴击伤害＞攻击力百分比＞元素精通\u003c/p\u003e\"],[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2123\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/07/21/75276545/eaef31b81b190dc676413b099c540526_6543346382757797116.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"神里绫华\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2123/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2123/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/07/21/75276545/eaef31b81b190dc676413b099c540526_6543346382757797116.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e神里绫华\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e冰风迷途的勇士能为神里绫华带来冰元素伤害加成以及大量的暴击率加成。使得神里绫华能在不堆暴击率的情况下不缺暴击率。是永冻流神里的毕业套装首选。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e时之沙：\u003c/strong\u003e攻击力百分比\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e空之杯：\u003c/strong\u003e冰元素伤害加成\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e理之冠：\u003c/strong\u003e暴击伤害\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e暴击率/暴击伤害＞攻击力百分比＞元素精通\u003c/p\u003e\"],[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"500286\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/10/17/4328207/e1f49352e0f53081cf6d7758cc9a8eef_77085490975887896.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"莱欧斯利\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/500286/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/500286/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/10/17/4328207/e1f49352e0f53081cf6d7758cc9a8eef_77085490975887896.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e莱欧斯利\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e冰风迷途的勇士能为莱欧斯利带来冰元素伤害加成以及大量的暴击率加成。通常作为永冻流或纯冰流莱欧斯利的圣遗物选择之一。使用此套装时着重注意暴击率的溢出情况。莱欧首选圣遗物为4\u003ca href=\\\"https://bbs.mihoyo.com/ys/obc/content/500037/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e猎人\u003c/a\u003e。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e时之沙：\u003c/strong\u003e攻击力百分比\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e空之杯：\u003c/strong\u003e冰元素伤害加成\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e理之冠：\u003c/strong\u003e暴击伤害\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e暴击率/暴击伤害＞攻击力百分比＞元素精通\u003c/p\u003e\"],[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2415\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/11/05/10875381/65886603cf7f0bdbaa82a165898237a3_1473519897376013260.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"埃洛伊\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2415/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2415/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/11/05/10875381/65886603cf7f0bdbaa82a165898237a3_1473519897376013260.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e埃洛伊\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e冰风迷途的勇士能为埃洛伊带来冰元素伤害加成以及大量的暴击率加成。永冻流或纯冰流可选4冰或4\u003ca href=\\\"https://bbs.mihoyo.com/ys/obc/content/2321/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e追忆\u003c/a\u003e作为毕业圣遗物。也可选择2冰+2攻来作为通用的圣遗物搭配。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e时之沙：\u003c/strong\u003e攻击力百分比\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e空之杯：\u003c/strong\u003e冰元素伤害加成\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e理之冠：\u003c/strong\u003e暴击率/暴击伤害\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e暴击率/暴击伤害＞攻击力百分比＞元素充能效率\u003c/p\u003e\"],[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"644\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/08/23/75276545/0bd80f58871b97281be47fcd6e2d7487_1302151446666002486.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"重云\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/644/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/644/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/08/23/75276545/0bd80f58871b97281be47fcd6e2d7487_1302151446666002486.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e重云\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e冰风迷途的勇士2件套能为重云带来冰元素伤害加成。选择冰风迷途的勇士2+\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/411/detail\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e昔日宗室之仪\u003c/a\u003e2来作为通用的圣遗物搭配。时之沙仅在融化队里携带元素精通，平时用攻击沙即可。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e时之沙：\u003c/strong\u003e攻击力百分比/元素精通\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e空之杯：\u003c/strong\u003e冰元素伤害加成\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e理之冠：\u003c/strong\u003e暴击率/暴击伤害\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e暴击率/暴击伤害＞攻击力百分比＞元素充能效率\u003c/p\u003e\"]]},{\"tab_name\":\"圣遗物成长数据\",\"header\":[\"详细属性\"],\"row\":[[\"\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"1279\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/11/29/76373921/d8aa4bdb17f0e16298b05c10bc149846_1243318391411958522.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"圣遗物成长数据\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1279/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1279/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/11/29/76373921/d8aa4bdb17f0e16298b05c10bc149846_1243318391411958522.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e圣遗物成长数据\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"10","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false}],"filter_values":{},"menu_id":"0","menu_name":"","version":"1789525803","langs":[],"template_layout":{"tab":[{"tab_id":"2","tab_name":"页签1","module_group":[{"module_group_id":"2","layout":"l1r1","module":[{"id":"4","pos":"banner"}],"name":"","repeated":false,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"3","layout":"l1r1","module":[